            "Outside the European Union, the EEA and the UK: load tracking until the visitor says no": [
                "Ni ita Agbegbe I\u1e63owo ti Yuroopu, EEA ati UK: koj\u1ecdp\u1ecd ipas\u1eb9 titi di igba ti alejo ba s\u1ecd p\u00e9 b\u1eb9\u1eb9k\u1ecd"
            ],
            "Off: every visitor must agree first (the strictest rule, and the default). On: only when your host or CDN reports the visitor's country (for example Cloudflare's CF-IPCountry header) and it is outside the EU, EEA, UK and Switzerland. The banner is still shown, and an unknown country is treated as inside the EU.": [
                "Pipa: gbogbo alejo gb\u1ecdd\u1ecd gba t\u1eb9l\u1eb9 (ofin ti o muna jul\u1ecd, ati aiyipada). Tan: nigbati ol\u00f9gbalejo r\u1eb9 tabi CDN ba royin oril\u1eb9-ede alejo (fun ap\u1eb9\u1eb9r\u1eb9 olori CF-IPCountry ti Cloudflare) ti o si wa ni ita EU, EEA, UK ati Switzerland. A n \u1e63afihan asia na sib\u1eb9sib\u1eb9, a si ka aim\u1ecd oril\u1eb9-ede bi \u1eb9ni pe o wa ninu EU."
            ],
            "Other scripts to hold until consent (handle:analytics or handle:marketing, comma separated)": [
                "Aw\u1ecdn iwe af\u1ecdw\u1ecdk\u1ecd miiran lati di titi di igba igbanilaaye (oju-am\u1ecd\u0300: analytics tabi oju-am\u1ecd\u0300: marketing, ti a ya s\u1ecdt\u1ecd p\u1eb9lu aami \u00e0m\u00ec-\u00ecse)"
